flowchart LR
    I[Input test image] --> WV[Wavelet structural view generator]
    WV --> V1[Original view]
    WV --> V2[Low-frequency view]
    WV --> V3[Detail / edge view]
    WV --> V4[Band-drop reconstruction]
    V1 --> CLIP[Frozen CLIP image encoder]
    V2 --> CLIP
    V3 --> CLIP
    V4 --> CLIP
    CLIP --> MAPS[Patch anomaly maps per structural view]
    MAPS --> STABLE[Confidence-selected stable regions]
    STABLE --> TTA[Test-time structural consensus tuning]
    TTA --> PARAM[Prompt / band gate / score head]
    PARAM --> MAPS
    MAPS --> RES[Cross-view residual field]
    MAPS --> MEAN[Mean semantic anomaly evidence]
    RES --> SCORE[Structural invariance anomaly score]
    MEAN --> SCORE
    SCORE --> OUT[Final anomaly map]
